# Soul Enervation {3}{B}'s "When this enchantment enters, target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn." Bot1 (four free Moxen and a
# Memnite) casts it on turn 3 against Bot2's Mox Sapphire and Aegis Turtle (a 0/5, so -4/-4 leaves exactly -4/1: -3/-3 would leave
# 2 and -5/-5 would kill it). Targets are creatures only: Bot2's Mox Sapphire is refused, and Bot1's own Memnite is a legal target.
# The enters ability drains nobody (the second ability needs a creature card to leave a graveyard), and on turn 4 the Turtle is a 0/5
# again (CR 514.2).

